  "title": "iEEG on children during slow wave sleep\n",
  "description": "This dataset contains intracranial EEG (iEEG) recordings acquired from 114 children during slow wave sleep, curated for use in a forthcoming manuscript by Sakakura et al. Electrode coordinates are provided in the MNI305 coordinate system, facilitating cross-subject spatial analyses. The dataset supports investigations into neural dynamics during sleep in pediatric populations undergoing intracranial monitoring.",
